{"seq":2,"slug":"seventh-chords","title":"七和弦体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/seventh-chords","wordCount":1408,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"七和弦体系\">七和弦体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>七和弦是在三和弦之上再叠一个三度得到四音和弦，多出的七音为和弦带来色彩与不稳定性。核心要抓住两点：其一，底层三和弦性质与七音类型的组合决定了五种常见七和弦；其二，七音本身带有强烈的解决倾向，尤其是属七和弦中的三全音，这使七和弦成为功能和声里推动进行的最有力工具。后文讨论的分布、转位与色彩，都围绕这根&quot;张力-解决&quot;的轴线展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"七和弦的形成原理\">七和弦的形成原理</h2><p>七和弦（Seventh Chord）是在三和弦基础上继续向上叠加一个三度音程而形成的四音和弦。新增的第四个音与根音之间的距离为七度，因此得名&quot;七和弦&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>七和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>三和弦</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>七音（根音上方某种七度）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{七和弦} = \\text{三和弦} + \\text{七音（根音上方某种七度）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">七和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">七音（根音上方某种七度）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>七音的加入为和弦增添了一层色彩与不稳定性。在功能和声中，七和弦比三和弦具有更强的&quot;运动倾向&quot;——七音有向下解决的需求，这使七和弦成为推动和声进行的有力工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;七和弦构成&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;根音&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;三音(大/小三度)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;五音(纯/增/减五度)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;七音(大/小七度)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;大七度 = 11半音&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;小七度 = 10半音&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"七和弦构成\"] --&gt; B[\"根音\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"三音(大/小三度)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"五音(纯/增/减五度)\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"七音(大/小七度)\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"大七度 = 11半音\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"小七度 = 10半音\"]</pre><h2 id=\"五种常见七和弦\">五种常见七和弦</h2><p>根据底层三和弦的性质与七音类型的组合，产生以下五种最常用的七和弦：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>七和弦类型</th>\n<th>三和弦底层</th>\n<th>七音类型</th>\n<th>标记</th>\n<th>音程结构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属七和弦</td>\n<td>大三</td>\n<td>小七度</td>\n<td>G7</td>\n<td>大三+小三+小三</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大七和弦</td>\n<td>大三</td>\n<td>大七度</td>\n<td>Cmaj7</td>\n<td>大三+小三+大三</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小七和弦</td>\n<td>小三</td>\n<td>小七度</td>\n<td>Dm7</td>\n<td>小三+大三+小三</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半减七和弦</td>\n<td>减三</td>\n<td>小七度</td>\n<td>Bø7</td>\n<td>小三+小三+大三</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减七和弦</td>\n<td>减三</td>\n<td>减七度</td>\n<td>B°7</td>\n<td>小三+小三+小三</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 C 为根音的各类七和弦构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（大七和弦）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{maj7} = C - E - G - B \\quad \\text{（大七和弦）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（大七和弦）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（属七和弦）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^7 = C - E - G - B\\flat \\quad \\text{（属七和弦）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（属七和弦）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（小七和弦）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cm^7 = C - E\\flat - G - B\\flat \\quad \\text{（小七和弦）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（小七和弦）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（半减七和弦）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{\\varnothing 7} = C - E\\flat - G\\flat - B\\flat \\quad \\text{（半减七和弦）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord amsrm mtight\">∅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（半减七和弦）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>∘</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（减七和弦）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{\\circ 7} = C - E\\flat - G\\flat - B\\flat\\flat \\quad \\text{（减七和弦）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（减七和弦）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"七和弦在调内的自然分布\">七和弦在调内的自然分布</h2><p>以自然大调为例，各级七和弦的分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级数</th>\n<th>C大调和弦</th>\n<th>七和弦类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>Cmaj7</td>\n<td>大七</td>\n<td>主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II</td>\n<td>Dm7</td>\n<td>小七</td>\n<td>下属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>Em7</td>\n<td>小七</td>\n<td>主（替代）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>Fmaj7</td>\n<td>大七</td>\n<td>下属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>G7</td>\n<td>属七</td>\n<td>属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VI</td>\n<td>Am7</td>\n<td>小七</td>\n<td>主（替代）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VII</td>\n<td>Bø7</td>\n<td>半减七</td>\n<td>属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>属七和弦（V7）是功能和声中最重要的七和弦——它包含三全音（根音上方的大三度与小七度之间形成增四度），这个三全音具有极强的向主和弦解决的倾向：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>G7 中的三全音：</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>F</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>增四度/减五度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G7 中的三全音：} B \\to F \\quad (\\text{增四度/减五度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G7 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中的三全音：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增四度</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">减五度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>解决方向：</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>↑</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>F</mi><mo>↓</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{解决方向：} B \\uparrow C, \\quad F \\downarrow E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解决方向：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 属七和弦解决&#10;        A[&quot;G7&lt;br/&gt;B-F 三全音&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;C&lt;br/&gt;C-E 解决&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; C[&quot;三全音收缩&lt;br/&gt;B→C, F→E&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 属七和弦解决\n        A[\"G7&lt;br/&gt;B-F 三全音\"] --&gt; B[\"C&lt;br/&gt;C-E 解决\"]\n        A --&gt; C[\"三全音收缩&lt;br/&gt;B→C, F→E\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"七和弦的转位\">七和弦的转位</h2><p>七和弦有四个音，因此有四种位置（原位 + 三个转位）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>低音</th>\n<th>数字低音标记</th>\n<th>简写</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原位</td>\n<td>根音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Double subscript at position 5: ^7_5_̲3\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">^7_5_3</span></span></td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一转位</td>\n<td>三音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Double subscript at position 5: ^6_5_̲3\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">^6_5_3</span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^6_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二转位</td>\n<td>五音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Double subscript at position 5: ^6_4_̲3\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">^6_4_3</span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^4_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三转位</td>\n<td>七音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Double subscript at position 5: ^6_4_̲2\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">^6_4_2</span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^4_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>属七和弦的转位在古典和声中有严格的使用规范：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（原位）：最常用，在完全终止中</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^{6}_{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：常用于中间进行</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^{4}_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：低音线性经过时使用</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^{4}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（也写作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）：解决到 I⁶（主和弦第一转位）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"七和弦的色彩特征与应用\">七和弦的色彩特征与应用</h2><p>每种七和弦具有独特的听觉&quot;性格&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>大七和弦</strong>：温暖、明亮、带有梦幻感。在流行音乐中常用于制造&quot;成人&quot;或&quot;精致&quot;的氛围。Burt Bacharach、Steely Dan 大量使用大七和弦。</p>\n<p><strong>属七和弦</strong>：紧张、推动力强。在布鲁斯中作为稳定和弦使用（I7-IV7-V7），在古典中仅作为解决前的张力和弦。</p>\n<p><strong>小七和弦</strong>：柔和、安静、内省。在 R&amp;B 与 Neo-Soul 中是核心和弦色彩。Erykah Badu、D&#39;Angelo 的作品充满小七和弦。</p>\n<p><strong>半减七和弦</strong>：忧郁中带紧张。在爵士中常作为 ii-V-I 小调进行中的 ii 使用。</p>\n<p><strong>减七和弦</strong>：对称结构（每个音之间距离相等 = 3 半音），方向不明确，是古典音乐中制造悬念与转调的利器。一个减七和弦可以解决到四个不同的调。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>七和弦</th>\n<th>情感色彩</th>\n<th>典型风格</th>\n<th>代表作品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>maj7</td>\n<td>温暖梦幻</td>\n<td>Bossa Nova, City Pop</td>\n<td>&quot;The Girl from Ipanema&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>推动紧张</td>\n<td>Blues, Funk</td>\n<td>&quot;Superstition&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>m7</td>\n<td>柔和内省</td>\n<td>R&amp;B, Neo-Soul</td>\n<td>&quot;Untitled&quot; (D&#39;Angelo)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ø7</td>\n<td>忧郁张力</td>\n<td>Jazz</td>\n<td>&quot;Autumn Leaves&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>°7</td>\n<td>悬念对称</td>\n<td>Classical, Film</td>\n<td>恐怖电影配乐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>七和弦 = 三和弦 + 七音，比三和弦更具运动倾向。</li>\n<li>五种常见类型：属七、大七、小七、半减七、减七。</li>\n<li>调内分布：I、IV 大七，ii、iii、vi 小七，V 属七，vii 半减七。</li>\n<li>属七和弦的三全音（如 G7 的 B-F）是功能和声推动力的来源。</li>\n<li>七和弦有四个位置（原位 + 三转位），各有数字低音标记。</li>\n<li>各类型有鲜明的听觉性格，从温暖梦幻（maj7）到悬念对称（°7）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>七和弦是在三和弦上叠加七音构成，回顾三和弦的四种类型与转位：<a href=\"triads\">三和弦的构成与分类</a></li>\n<li>七音的解决倾向（如 G7 的 F 下行到 E）是声部连接的核心规则：<a href=\"../voice-leading/voice-leading-principles\">声部连接原则</a></li>\n<li>属七和弦中的三全音是功能和声推动力的来源，详见终止式与功能分析：<a href=\"../chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">功能和声与进行模型</a></li>\n<li>七和弦的协和与不协和感本质上由各音的泛音叠加决定，可从声学频谱角度理解：<a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/fft-fundamentals\">频谱分析基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"七和弦体系","id":"七和弦体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"七和弦的形成原理","id":"七和弦的形成原理"},{"level":2,"text":"五种常见七和弦","id":"五种常见七和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"七和弦在调内的自然分布","id":"七和弦在调内的自然分布"},{"level":2,"text":"七和弦的转位","id":"七和弦的转位"},{"level":2,"text":"七和弦的色彩特征与应用","id":"七和弦的色彩特征与应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"三和弦的构成与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/triads"},"next":{"title":"延伸和弦与复杂结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/extended-chords"}}